  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Programme Supporting Chad, Ethiopia and South Sudan to Respond to the Sudan Crisis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the regional programme is to enable the inclusion of refugees and returnees fleeing the Sudan crisis in national systems of service delivery, while improving their self-reliance through economic inclusion and support to livelihoods, together with host communities. To achieve this overall objective, the project will need to support national and sub-national institutions and systems to address the challenges of forced displacement in Ethiopia and South Sudan. Through this action, local development efforts will be strengthened, and investments will be made, to encourage peaceful coexistence between displaced and affected communities.</narrative>
  </description>
